# Normalise line endings in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Biome formats to LF, so a Windows checkout that materialises CRLF leaves the
# working tree permanently "unformatted" against the committed content: the
# files are byte-identical to HEAD yet `biome check` reports fourteen of them as
# needing reformatting, and `pnpm lint` fails.
#
# `eol=lf` makes the checkout match the stored blob on every platform, which is
# what keeps `lint` and `build` green for a reviewer on Windows as well.
* text=auto eol=lf

